      "writtenOn": "2025-10-06T20:44:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If there was an internal error from the task, it would convert to wgpu::ErrorType::Unknown. It wouldn\u0027t be in the list of unhandled wgpu::ErrorTypes so this makes sure it\u0027s forwarded to HandleError.\n\nI could alternatively have `ErrorScopeStack::HandleErrorGeneratingAsyncTask` always add `wgpu::ErrorType::Unknown` to the set.",
